hadiths[14]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1088","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas pyaala laaya gaya. To Aap ne us mein se piya jabke Aap key daaen taraf qaum ka sab se chhota ladka tha aur budhey baaen taraf they. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae ladkey! Kya tum mujhey ijazat detey ho ke main use budhon ko dun? Us ne kaha: Main tum se apne fazl mein kisi ko tarjeeh na dunga Ya Rasulullah! To Aap ne use usey dey diya. (Bukhari: 2351)"
"1089","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key liye merey ghar mein paaltu bakri ka doodh doha gaya aur uskey doodh mein merey ghar key kuwein key paani se milaaya gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko pyaala diya gaya aur Aap ne us mein se piya yahan tak ke jab Aap ne pyaala apne munh se hataaya. Aur Aap key baaen taraf Abu Bakr they aur daaen taraf dehaati tha. To Umar ne kaha jabke unhey khauf tha ke Aap use dehaati ko dengey: Abu Bakr ko dijiye Ya Rasulullah jo tumharey paas hain. To Aap ne use dehaati ko diya jo Aap key daaen taraf tha, phir farmaya: Daaen taraf phir daaen taraf. (Bukhari: 2352)"
"1090","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Paani ka bacha hua na roka jaey taake uskey sath ghaas roki jaey. (Bukhari: 2353)"
"1091","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Paani ka bacha hua na roko taake uskey sath ghaas ka bacha hua roko. (Bukhari: 2354)"
"1092","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo qasam khaey jis se wo Musalman aadmi ka maal kaatey jabke wo us par jhootha ho to wo Allah se milega jabke wo us par ghussa hoga. To Allah Taala ne naazil farmaya: (Beshak jo Allah key ahd aur apni qasmon key badley thodi qeemat khareedtey hain) aayat. To Ashas aey aur unhon-ne kaha: Tumhey Abu Abdur Rahman ne kya bayan kya? Merey baarey mein ye aayat naazil hui. Mera merey chacha zaad bhai ki zameen mein kuwaan tha. To us ne mujh se kaha: Tumharey gawaah (laao). Main ne kaha: Merey gawaah nahi hain. Us ne kaha: To uski qasam. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Phir wo qasam khaaeyga. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye hadees zikr ki. To Allah ne uski tasdeeq mein wo naazil farmaya. (Bukhari: 2357)"
"1093","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen hain jin ki taraf Allah Qiyaamat key din na dekhega aur na unhey paak karega aur unkey liye dardnaak azaab hai: Aadmi jiskey paas raastey mein paani bacha hua tha aur us ne use musaafir se rok diya. Aur aadmi jis ne Imam se baiat ki, us se sirf duniya key liye baiat karta hai. Phir agar wo use us mein se dey to raazi hota hai aur agar use us mein se na dey to naaraaz hota hai. Aur aadmi jis ne Asr key baad apna saamaan rakkha aur kaha: Qasam us Allah ki jiskey siwa koi mabood nahi! Beshak mujhey uskey liye itna itna diya gaya tha. To aadmi ne usey sachcha samjha. Phir Aap ne ye aayat padhi: (Beshak jo Allah key ahd aur apni qasmon key badley thodi qeemat khareedtey hain). (Bukhari: 2358). Abdullah bin Zubair (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne bayan kya: Ansaar mein se aik aadmi ne Zubair se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas Harra key naalon key baarey mein jhagda kya jin se wo khajooron ko seerab kartey they. To Ansaari ne kaha: Paani chhoro, guzarney do. To us ne us par inkaar kya. To wo donon Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas jhagdey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zubair se farmaya: Seerab karo ae Zubair! Phir paani apne padosi ki taraf bhej do. To Ansaari ghussa hua aur us ne kaha: Kya isliye ke wo tumhaari phuphi ka beta hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka chehra badal gaya. Phir farmaya: Seerab karo ae Zubair! Phir paani rokey rakkho yahan tak ke wo deewar tak wapas aaey. To Zubair ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak main gumaan karta hun ke ye aayat uskey baarey mein naazil hui: (To nahi, tumharey Rab ki qasam! Wo imaan na laaengey yahan tak ke tumhey faisla karne wala banaaein jo unkey darmiyaan jhagda hua). (2359). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1094","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jabke aik aadmi chal raha tha aur us par pyaas sakht ho gai to wo kuwein mein utra aur us mein se piya. Phir nikla to wo kuttey key paas tha jo pyaas se mitti khaata hua haanp raha tha. To us ne kaha: Beshak use waisa pahuncha hai jaisa mujhey pahuncha tha. To us ne apna moza bhara, phir use apne munh se pakda, phir chadha aur kuttey ko pilaaya. To Allah ne uska shukr ada kya aur usey maaf kar diya. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya beshak hamaarey liye jaanvaron mein ajr hai? Aap ne farmaya: Har taaza kaleijey mein ajr hai. (Bukhari: 2363)"
"1095","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Teen hain jin se Allah Qiyaamat key din baat na karega aur na unki taraf dekhega: Aadmi jis ne saamaan par qasam khai ke use uskey liye us se zyada diya gaya tha jo use diya gaya tha jabke wo jhootha hai. Aur aadmi jis ne Asr key baad jhoothi qasam khai taake uskey sath Musalman aadmi ka maal kaatey. Aur aadmi jis ne paani ka bacha hua rok diya. To Allah farmaata hai: Aaj main tum se apna fazl rokta hun jaisey tum ne uskey fazl ko roka jo tumharey haathon ne nahi kya tha. (Bukhari: 2369)"
"1096","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Main zaroor aadmiyon ko apne hauz se haankunga jaisey ajnabi oont hauz se haankey jaatey hain. (Bukhari: 2367)"
"1097","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Teen hain jin se Allah Qiyaamat key din baat na karega aur na unki taraf dekhega: Aadmi jis ne saamaan par qasam khai ke use uskey liye us se zyada diya gaya tha jo use diya gaya tha jabke wo jhootha hai. Aur aadmi jis ne Asr key baad jhoothi qasam khai taake uskey sath Musalman aadmi ka maal kaatey. Aur aadmi jis ne paani ka bacha hua rok diya. To Allah farmaata hai: Aaj main tum se apna fazl rokta hun jaisey tum ne uskey fazl ko roka jo tumharey haathon ne nahi kya tha. (Bukhari: 2369)"
"1098","[AI-translation] Saab bin Jassaama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hima Allah aur uskey Rasool key siwa kisi key liye nahi hai. (Bukhari: 2370)"
"1099","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghodey aadmi key liye ajr hain. Aur aadmi key liye parda hain. Aur aadmi par bojh hain. Lekin jo uskey liye ajr hain to aadmi jis ne use Allah key raastey mein baandha aur use charaagaah ya baagh mein lambi rassi se baandha. To jo us ne uski lambi rassi mein us charaagaah ya baagh mein se paaya wo uskey liye nekiyaan thein. Aur agar uski lambi rassi toot gai aur wo aik ya do teelon par dauda to uskey nishaan aur uski leed uskey liye nekiyaan thein. Aur agar wo nehar key paas se guzra aur us mein se piya jabke wo pilana nahi chaahta tha to wo uskey liye nekiyaan tha. To wo uskey liye ajr hai. Aur aadmi jis ne use beniyaazi aur paakdaamani key liye baandha, phir uski gardano aur uski peethon mein Allah ka haq na bhoola to wo uskey liye parda hai. Aur aadmi jis ne use fakhr aur dikhaawey aur Musalmaanon se dushmani key liye baandha to wo us par bojh hai. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se gadhon key baarey mein poochha gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Mujh par uskey baarey mein kuchh naazil nahi hua magar ye jaame maani aayat: (To jo zarra baraabar bhalai karega use dekhega aur jo zarra baraabar buraai karega use dekhega). (Bukhari: 2371)"
"1100","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chaaha ke Bahrein mein se (zameen) kaatein. To Ansaar ne kaha: Yahan tak ke tum hamaarey Muhaajireen bhaiyon ko utna kaato jitna tum hamein kaattey ho. Aap ne farmaya: Tum merey baad tarjeeh dekhogey. To sabr karo yahan tak ke mujh se milo. (Bukhari: 2377)"
"1101","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo khajoor khareedey uskey pewand honay key baad to uska phal bechney waley ka hai magar ye ke khareedne wala shart lagaaey. Aur jo ghulaam khareedey jabke uskey paas maal ho to uska maal uska hai jis ne use becha magar ye ke khareedne wala shart lagaaey. (Bukhari: 2379). Qarz lenay aur qarz ada karney, pathar aur deewaala ki kitaab."
